      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Now, therefore, by virtue of the authority vested in me as Mayor of The City of New York, it is hereby ordered that the following Regulations Governing Cash Payments for Unused Accrued Annual Leave and Unused Accrued Compensatory Time on Death of such an Employee while in the City's employ be and the same are hereby established:",
