        1286,
        1278
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. Effective January 1, 1971, in the case of an incumbent of a position in a class of positions listed above, the beneficiary designated under the Retirement System or, if no beneficiary is so designated, the estate of the deceased shall receive payment in cash for the following as a death benefit:",
      "logprob_stats": {
